    <mxCell id="leg" value="LEGEND
━━ Orange solid  =  BGP (TCP 179) + BFD (UDP 3784 / 3785 / 4784)          ━━ Purple solid  =  T0 Service Router + Inter-SR BGP + BFD multi-hop UDP 4784
╌╌ Orange dashed  =  NSX Federation  TCP 443 + TCP 1236 (⚠️ must be whitelisted)          ╌╌ Green dashed  =  GENEVE overlay UDP 6081 + RTEP cross-AZ
